<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Jan industrial production falls 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Jan industrial production falls 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial production fell 2.1 percent in January from December last year, while it rose 9.7 percent year-on-year, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p>(Percentage change)   Jan 97    Dec 96*     yr/yr</p>
<p>			    -2.1	3.2	   9.7</p>
<p>NOTE-The December figure was revised to 3.2 percent from 4.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
